    "chunk_text": "& hunan & centaurian, \u00fe\u00e6t is \u00deu meaht geseon \u00e6t \u00feam \u00e6r genemdan adlum hu \u00feu \u00f0one oxumelle wyrcean scealt. Aleres rinde seo\u00fe on w\u00e6tre o\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6s w\u00e6tres sie \u00feriddan d\u00e6l unbewelled & sele \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6s godne \u00deis ilce deah lendenseocum men. Eft, \u00fe\u00e6s blacan ifiges croppan \u00e6rest \u00fereo, eft V, \u00feonne VII, \u00feonne nigon, \u00feonne XI, \u00feonne XIII, Gif se man h\u00e6bbe eac fefer sele \u00feu \u00fea cyrnlu \u00fe\u00e6s eor\u00feifiges on hatum w\u00e6tre drincan. \u00deis ilce deah wi\u00fe lendenseocum men. Eft, eor\u00f0geallan on wine gesodenne sele drincan. Eft, betonican wyl on wine, sele drincan. Sealf & onlegen wi\u00f0 milte w\u00e6rce, wyrc of hunige & of ecede, do melu & lins\u00e6d to & beres grytta, Do eac driges wermodes blostman to. Eft, \u00feonne se milte ablawen wyr\u00f0 sona he wile aheardian & bi\u00fe \u00feonne unea\u00fel\u00e6cne \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t blod Lacna hine \u00feonne mid \u00feam \u00e6r genemdan wyrtum, meng \u00fea godan wyrta wi\u00f0 oxumelli, \u00feonne \u00dea lacnia\u00f0 \u00feone milte & aweg ado\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feicce & lifrige blod & \u00fea yfelan w\u00e6tan, n\u00e6s \u00feurh \u00f0a Hirdewyrt seo l\u00e6sse lege gebeatene utan, nim eac cl\u00e6fran wyrttruman, do on eced & gate tyrdlu, Wi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6re heardnesse & sare \u00fe\u00e6s miltes, swines bl\u00e6dran nim swa niwe, gefyl",
